# Rotating wedges filled with clouds that boil over time.

description "Rotating wedges filled with clouds that boil over time."
tags "pattern" "symmetry" "color"

rotate(angle: t * 0.15)
  |> kaleidoscope(segments: 6)
  |> clouds(z: t * 0.3, scale: 2.5)
  |> hsv(hue: _, saturation: 0.9, value: 1)
  |> out.color
